---
/**
 * GlassmorphicNavButton.astro
 *
 * Replicated from lossless-group/site
 * `src/components/basics/navigation/GlassmorphicNavButton.astro`.
 * A round, blurred, frosted-glass nav button with an inline chevron.
 *
 * Adapted: the source's `rgba(255, 255, 255, …)` fills assume a dark ground and
 * go invisible on paper. They are expressed here as `color-mix()` against
 * `--clr-ink`, which keeps the glassmorphism (the backdrop blur is untouched)
 * while surviving light and vibrant modes.
 *
 * PROPS:
 * - direction ('left' | 'right', required): which way the chevron points
 * - label (string, required): accessible name
 * - href (string, optional): renders an <a> instead of a <button>
 * - onClick (string, optional): inline handler, for parity with the source
 * - class (string, optional)
 */
interface Props {
  direction: 'left' | 'right';
  href?: string;
  label: string;
  onClick?: string;
  class?: string;
}

const { direction, href, label, onClick, class: className = '' } = Astro.props;

const Tag = href ? 'a' : 'button';
const tagProps = href
  ? { href }
  : onClick
    ? { onclick: onClick, type: 'button' as const }
    : { type: 'button' as const };
---

<Tag class:list={['glassmorphic-nav-button', className]} aria-label={label} {...tagProps}>
  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    {direction === 'left' ? (
      <path d="M15 18L9 12L15 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    ) : (
      <path d="M9 18L15 12L9 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    )}
  </svg>
</Tag>

<style>
  .glassmorphic-nav-button {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--clr-ink) 10%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--clr-line);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--clr-ink-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px var(--clr-shadow);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .glassmorphic-nav-button:hover {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--clr-ink) 18%, transparent);
    border-color: var(--clr-line-strong);
    color: var(--clr-ink);
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .glassmorphic-nav-button:active {
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }

  .glassmorphic-nav-button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--clr-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .glassmorphic-nav-button {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .glassmorphic-nav-button {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
    }
  }
</style>
